{"id":"265b037f1125c93c","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-utm.md","title":"通用机器性质","display":"df-utm — 通用机器性质","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-utm","aliases":["20-df-utm"],"display":"df-utm — 通用机器性质","chapter":"1","section":"1.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 1.5.3（性质的原子化）","source_pdf_pages":[47],"source_printed_pages":[11],"depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-utm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-utm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-utm — 通用机器性质"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 1.5.3（性质的原子化）"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>47</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>11</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\omega\">\\(u\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\varphi_u\">\\(U=\\varphi_u\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}utm}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Universal}(u)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall e,x\\in\\omega\\\n[\\varphi_u(\\langle e,x\\rangle)\\simeq\\varphi_e(x)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}utm}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Universal}(u)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall e,x\\in\\omega\\\n[\\varphi_u(\\langle e,x\\rangle)\\simeq\\varphi_e(x)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是机器索引的性质定义；存在通用机器需 Enumeration Theorem，不用定义符号 coloneqq 代替模拟等式。部分相等保证发散输入的行为也被保留。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 1.5.3（性质的原子化）；印刷页 11；PDF 第 47 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"u\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"U=\\varphi_u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}utm}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Universal}(u)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall e,x\\in\\omega\\\n[\\varphi_u(\\langle e,x\\rangle)\\simeq\\varphi_e(x)].","display":true}],"bytes":1067,"backlinks":[{"id":"6e5fa86a227392e1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-utm]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"}],"outgoing":["dc642dd12c05d028","35073b74f84433b3"]}